flowchart TD
  Start[Start: npm start] --> App[startCharon]
  App --> Init[init: validateConfig + initDb + initLiveExecution + setupTelegram]

  Init --> Mode{SIGNAL_SERVER_URL set?}

  Mode -- Yes --> ServerPoll[poll signal server]
  ServerPoll --> StratGates[strategy gates]
  StratGates -->|pass| Trigger[trigger candidate]
  StratGates -->|dip_buy wait_for_dip| PriceAlert[store/monitor dip alerts]
  PriceAlert --> Trigger

  Mode -- No --> WSGate{FEE_CLAIM_WS_ENABLED?}
  WSGate -- Yes --> FeeWS[feeClaim websocket logs]
  Mode -- No --> GradPoll[poll graduated -> map]
  Mode -- No --> TrendPoll[poll trending -> map + degen handler]
  FeeWS --> Trigger
  TrendPoll --> Trigger
  GradPoll -. enrich .-> Trigger

  Trigger --> Build[build + enrich candidate]
  Build --> Filters{filters pass?}
  Filters -- No --> Drop[drop]
  Filters -- Yes --> Persist[save candidate to SQLite]

  Persist --> Decide{use_llm?}
  Decide -- No --> AutoBuy[auto BUY]
  Decide -- Yes --> Batch[load batch]
  Batch --> LLM[LLM pick <= 1 BUY]
  LLM --> Decision[store decision]

  AutoBuy --> Approved
  Decision --> Approved{BUY approved?}
  Approved -- No --> NoEntry[no entry]
  Approved -- Yes --> FreshCheck[fresh execution check]

  FreshCheck -- Fail --> RejectFresh[reject entry]
  FreshCheck -- Pass --> ExecMode{TRADING_MODE}

  ExecMode -- dry_run --> Dry[create dry-run position]
  ExecMode -- confirm --> Intent[create trade intent]
  Intent -- approve --> LiveBuy[live buy]
  Intent -- reject --> RejectIntent[reject intent]
  ExecMode -- live --> LiveBuy

  LiveBuy --> Jupiter[jupiter order->sign->execute]
  Jupiter --> LivePos[create live position]

  Dry --> OpenPos((open position))
  LivePos --> OpenPos

  App --> MonitorLoop[every POSITION_CHECK_MS: monitorPositions]
  MonitorLoop --> RefreshPos[refresh position]
  RefreshPos --> ExitRules{exit rules hit?}
  ExitRules -- No --> Keep[keep open]
  ExitRules -- Yes --> ExitAction{live?}
  ExitAction -- No --> CloseSim[close dry-run]
  ExitAction -- Yes --> LiveSell[live sell via Jupiter]
  LiveSell --> CloseLive[close live]

  NoEntry --> TG[telegram]
  Dry --> TG
  LivePos --> TG
  CloseSim --> TG
  CloseLive --> TG
  RejectFresh --> TG

